module std.css.properties.ColumnHeight.

/// The initial value. If the content container has a set height, the content columns will grow to
/// that height, overflowing to the side if the content doesn't fit inside the container. If the
/// content container does not have a set height, the content will be equally distributed between the
/// columns generated inside the container.

